{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c025a0e3d9b6b527","name":"Matukai Adept Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-c025a0e3d9b6b527","title":"Matukai Adept Talent Tree","revision":20482,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:56:11Z","sha256":"1425f8cbc47af6b4dd6ed6d889f95c71c0acbe856ab179cb1e95e52a0e04f2b7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20482","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Matukai%20Adept%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c025a0e3d9b6b527","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All Matukai strive to achieve harmony between the physical and the spiritual aspects of their lives. As a result, they find ways to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," in improve their bodies. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Matukai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Matukai","referenceId":"reference:e831daaf795b9730"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Body Control"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier instead of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," modifier to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". Additionally, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to become immune to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disease"}," until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Physical Surge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you roll an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," check at the start of combat, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," immediately, regardless of whether or not you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Soft to Solid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," when you are damaged by an attack, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to increase the rigidity of your skin, gaining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10 until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wan-Shen Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Simple_Weapons)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"}," to parry your opponents' attacks, gaining a +1 deflection bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"}," until the start of your next turn. You must have your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"}," in hand to use this Talent, and you do not gain the deflection bonus if you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," or otherwise unaware of the incoming attack. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, the deflection bonus increases by +1 (to a maximum of +3).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wan-Shen Kata"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Simple_Weapons)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You treat the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"}," as a Medium weapon instead of a Large weapon. You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"}," feats with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"},", substituting your attack bonus with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"}," for your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check. You must have your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"}," in hand to use this Talent. In addition, when you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Weapon"},", you reduce all attack penalties for attacking with both ends of the weapon by 1.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wan-Shen Mastery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +5, ",{"tag":"b","children":["Wan-Shen Kata"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Simple_Weapons)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you make two attacks with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"},", each one against a different target within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"},". You must have your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wan-Shen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wan-Shen","referenceId":"reference:a5bef67f37df2da3"}," in hand to use this Talent.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
